---

Third-party runtime dependencies are listed in `uv.lock`. One carries a licence other than
MIT/BSD/Apache: `certifi`, pulled in transitively by `httpx` via `httpcore`, is MPL-2.0.
It is consumed unmodified, which MPL-2.0 permits without further obligation. Vendoring or
patching the CA bundle into a redistributed artifact would require carrying the MPL notice
with it — logged here so that edit is a known event rather than a discovery.
